@startuml
' SET09803 DevOps Coursework - Requirement 31 Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Data Researcher" as Researcher
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Retrieve City Population" as UC_CityPopulation
    usecase "Validate City" as UC_ValidateCity
    usecase "Query City Population Data" as UC_QueryCity
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UC_Error
}

' Primary Actor Interactions
Researcher --> UC_CityPopulation

' Sub-task dependencies (Includes)
UC_CityPopulation .> UC_ValidateCity : <<include>>
UC_CityPopulation .> UC_QueryCity : <<include>>

' System Actor Interactions
UC_QueryCity --> DB

' Failure Extension
UC_CityPopulation <.. UC_Error : <<extend>>\n(Invalid City or\nDatabase Failure)

' Notes
note right of UC_CityPopulation
  Retrieves the population
  of a selected city for
  municipal population analysis
end note

note right of UC_QueryCity
  Queries the population value
  for the selected city
  from the database
end note

note bottom of UC_Error
  Triggered if the city
  is invalid, MySQL database
  is unreachable, or required
  population data is missing
end note

@enduml